    },
    {
      "dir": "a2c",
      "frame": {
        "jsonrpc": "2.0",
        "method": "session/update",
        "params": {
          "sessionId": "01JB8Q2W6R9T3M5K7N1P4X8Z0C",
          "update": {
            "sessionUpdate": "available_commands_update",
            "availableCommands": {
              "$any": []
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "dir": "a2c",
      "note": "ответ session/load — после реплея (ACP-3)",
      "frame": {
        "jsonrpc": "2.0",
        "id": "${loadId}",
        "result": {
          "modes": {
            "$any": {
              "availableModes": [
                {
                  "id": "standard",
                  "name": "Standard"
                }
              ],
              "currentModeId": "standard"
            }
          },
          "configOptions": {
            "$any": []
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "dir": "a2c",
      "note": "D8: снимок load — после ответа на session/load, а не в конце реплея; session — полная сумма журнала (turns 2, steps 2), partial без beforeLoad; context неизвестен мосту, turnId, step и turn нет",
      "frame": {
        "jsonrpc": "2.0",
        "method": "_codelab/session/usage",
        "params": {
          "sessionId": "01JB8Q2W6R9T3M5K7N1P4X8Z0C",
